        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi oryakora omukingo gw'okukinga aha muryango gw'eihema, ogukore omu myenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani, gutariizemu amabara gacwereraine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
