              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogwo mukingo ogukorere enyomyo z'eminyinya itaano, ozishwekye n'ezaabu; eby'okuhanikaho byazo bibe eby'ezaabu; kandi oyazye omuringa, ogukoremu ebiina byazo bitaano.",
